rature to – 25 °C and for E2 class and O class for the flow transmitter. Addition of software version.\" (join <br> parts with space)\n- 4 | 26 August 2021 | \"Addition of full-bore sizes up to DN1200.\"\n- 5 | 23 November 2021 | \"Addition of full-bore sizes up to DN1800.\"\n- 6 | 20 May 2022 | \"Addition of accuracy class 1 to DN1800.\"\n- 7 | 30 August 2022 | \"Software version updates due to addition of microprocessors.\"\n- 8 | 3 July 2023 | \"Software update\"\n- 9 | 23 September 2023 | \"Addition of AquaMaster4 FEW45Y.Z Mobile comms variant of calculating and indicating device. Software update\"\n- 10 | 26 February 2024 | \"Software update and change to U200 wireless module for global use.\"\n- 11 | 27 January 2024 | \"Software update.\"\n- 12 | 7 April 2025 | \"Hardware update due to the addition of resistor alternatives.\"\n- 13 | 5 June 2025 | \"Software update.\"\n- 14 | 8 January 2026 | \"Documentation folder update.\"\n- 15 | 16 February 2026 | \"Software update.\"\n\nThe schema says revision is a string e.g. \"0\" not 0 → \"Initial\", \"1\", etc.\n\nDates: schema says date — I'll use ISO \"2020-08-14\".\n\nmatrix_tables descriptions: note page span for table 11.\n\nUnits: m³ — use \"m³\" unicode. unit for meter size: \"mm\" (DN is nominal diameter in mm per header). Columns units: [\"mm\", \"m³\", \"m³\", \"m³\"].\n\nconfig_level entries — let me finalize groups:\n\nTable 9 (reduced bore, AC mains):\n- indicating_range_maximum_value: [{\"condition\": \"DN40-DN600\", \"value\": 9999999, unit m³}]\n- indicating_range_minimum_value: [{\"condition\": \"DN40-DN65\", 99999}, {\"condition\": \"DN80-DN200\", 999999}, {\"condition\": \"DN250-DN600\", 9999999}]\n- verification_scale_interval_maximum_value: [{\"DN40-DN80\", 0.0001}, {\"DN100-DN250\", 0.001}, {\"DN300-DN600\", 0.01}]\n\nTable 10 (reduced bore, battery/renewable):\n- max: DN40-DN600: 9999999\n- min: DN40-DN50: 99999; DN65-DN150: 999999; DN200-DN600: 9999999\n- vsi: DN40-DN50: 0.0001; DN65-DN150: 0.